### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains HTTP client.
@host = http://localhost:8080
@tenant = ACME

### Health
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Products
GET {{host}}/api/products
X-Tenant-Code: {{tenant}}

### Create a product
POST {{host}}/api/products
X-Tenant-Code: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "SKU-9001", "name": "Strapping Band", "unitOfMeasure": "ROLL" }

### Warehouses
GET {{host}}/api/warehouses
X-Tenant-Code: {{tenant}}

### Record a receipt (positive quantity; server signs it)
POST {{host}}/api/stock-movements
X-Tenant-Code: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "warehouseId": 1, "productId": 1, "movementType": "RECEIPT", "quantity": 25, "referenceNo": "PO-1001" }

### Record an issue (outbound)
POST {{host}}/api/stock-movements
X-Tenant-Code: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "warehouseId": 1, "productId": 1, "movementType": "ISSUE", "quantity": 10, "referenceNo": "SO-2002" }

### Stock sheet with running balance (window function)
GET {{host}}/api/stock/sheet?warehouseId=1&productId=1
X-Tenant-Code: {{tenant}}

### On-hand snapshot with per-warehouse share
GET {{host}}/api/stock/on-hand
X-Tenant-Code: {{tenant}}

### Queue a bulk logistics update (ids from the movements list)
POST {{host}}/api/logistics/bulk-update
X-Tenant-Code: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "movementIds": [1, 2, 3] }

### Outbox status (pending / processing / done / dead)
GET {{host}}/api/ops/outbox
X-Tenant-Code: {{tenant}}

### Tenant isolation check: GLOBEX must not see ACME's data
GET {{host}}/api/products
X-Tenant-Code: GLOBEX
